{"seq":4,"slug":"major-works","title":"列奥纳多·达·芬奇·代表成就","stage":"DONE","category":"leonardo-da-vinci","categoryLabel":"列奥纳多·达·芬奇","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/major-works","rating":{"composite":3.71,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/35_leonardo-da-vinci/4_major-works","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"列奥纳多-达-芬奇-代表成就\">列奥纳多·达·芬奇·代表成就</h1><p>本 hub 聚焦达·芬奇<strong>作为具体作品的代表成就</strong>——逐件拆解三组传世杰作的硬事实、技法机制、创作权衡与历史命运，把&quot;世界名作&quot;还原为可理解、可核验的对象。这里关心的是&quot;这件作品到底是什么、解决了什么问题、为何重要&quot;，而非他抽象的思想或一生轨迹。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>达·芬奇集合下有六个 hub，本 hub 是&quot;作品本位&quot;的那一个，与其余五个互补而不重叠：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>人生轨迹与历史背景</td>\n<td>提供作品诞生的时空脉络（如米兰岁月）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>绘画/科学/工程的领域成就</td>\n<td>本 hub 是这些贡献的<strong>具体作品实例</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>观察、跨学科、笔记本等方法论</td>\n<td>解释作品背后的工作方式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>代表成就（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td><strong>逐件作品的拆解</strong></td>\n<td><strong>把抽象贡献落到具体物件</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>后世接受与文化地位</td>\n<td>接续本 hub，讲作品&quot;之后&quot;的故事</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>未竟、谜团、多元评价</td>\n<td>与本 hub 的&quot;脆弱&quot;&quot;谜&quot;&quot;影响悖论&quot;呼应</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话：<strong>核心贡献讲&quot;他擅长什么&quot;，本 hub 讲&quot;具体哪几件作品、好在哪、有何代价&quot;。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"三章导览\">三章导览</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>作品</th>\n<th>核心看点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"mona-lisa/\">蒙娜丽莎</a></td>\n<td>油画肖像</td>\n<td>晕涂法、微笑的视觉机制、登顶的真正归因；身份/失窃等谜团的证据分级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"the-last-supper/\">最后的晚餐</a></td>\n<td>壁画</td>\n<td>透视+分组+明暗的三位一体构图；secco 媒材导致的脆弱与 21 年大修复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"drawings/\">维特鲁威人与手稿</a></td>\n<td>素描/解剖手稿</td>\n<td>圆方比例的几何与原创修正；解剖发现、科学可视化与&quot;零影响&quot;悖论</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径与前置\">推荐学习路径与前置</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>前置</strong>：建议先读 <a href=\"../life-and-times/the-milan-years/\">生平 · 米兰岁月</a> 了解《最后的晚餐》的委托背景，再看本 hub 会更有脉络。</li>\n<li><strong>路径 A（大众入门）</strong>：蒙娜丽莎 → 最后的晚餐 → 维特鲁威人，从最熟悉到稍专业。</li>\n<li><strong>路径 B（方法论视角）</strong>：先读 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/observation/\">思想与方法 · 观察</a>，再读维特鲁威人与解剖手稿，体会&quot;实测修正权威&quot;的一以贯之。</li>\n<li><strong>延伸</strong>：读完本 hub 后转 <a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a> 看这些作品的后世命运，或转 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a> 深入&quot;未竟&quot;&quot;谜团&quot;等张力。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"贯穿全-hub-的三条主线\">贯穿全 hub 的三条主线</h2><p>读完三章，会反复遇到三个达·芬奇式的母题：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>为创作自由牺牲耐久/完成度</strong>——晕涂法的慢工、《最后的晚餐》弃用湿壁画、终生不&quot;定稿&quot;，都是同一选择的不同面相。</li>\n<li><strong>以实测对话权威</strong>——维特鲁威人修正古人几何、解剖手稿用亲手解剖记录人体，体现观察高于教条。</li>\n<li><strong>成就的高度 ≠ 历史的影响</strong>——解剖手稿超越时代却生前零影响，提醒我们评价先驱时分清两者。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>带着这三条主线读，零散的作品便串成了一个连贯的达·芬奇。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mona-lisa","title":"蒙娜丽莎","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/major-works/mona-lisa","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-worlds-most-famous-painting","title":"世界最著名的画作","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/major-works/mona-lisa/the-worlds-most-famous-painting"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-enduring-mystery","title":"永恒的谜","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/major-works/mona-lisa/the-enduring-mystery"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-last-supper","title":"最后的晚餐","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/major-works/the-last-supper","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-masterpiece-of-composition","title":"构图的杰作","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/major-works/the-last-supper/a-masterpiece-of-composition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fame-and-fragility","title":"盛名与脆弱","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/major-works/the-last-supper/fame-and-fragility"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"drawings","title":"维特鲁威人与手稿","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/major-works/drawings","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-vitruvian-man","title":"维特鲁威人","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/major-works/drawings/the-vitruvian-man"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-anatomical-drawings","title":"解剖手稿","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/major-works/drawings/the-anatomical-drawings"}]}]}